     *   <li>Copies the system/public IDs to the {@link InputSource}.</li>
     *   <li>Obtains a {@link SAXParserFactory} (either from the {@link Exchange}
     *       or a new instance) and configures it to:
     *       <ul>
     *         <li>Enable secure processing.</li>
     *         <li>Disable external general entities.</li>
     *         <li>Disable external parameter entities.</li>
     *         <li>Disable loading of external DTDs and DTD grammars.</li>
     *         <li>Make the parser namespace‑aware.</li>
